abstract: >-
  A collection of AI-assisted research on open graph-theory problems, seeking
  to prove, disprove, or make partial progress. Candidate results were generated
  with GPT-5.6 Sol, and claimed proofs and counterexamples were subjected to
  adversarial review with Claude Fable 5.

